<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include("partials/head") %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("partials/header") %>

    <main>
        <div class="breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Products</a><span>/</span><span><%= product.name %></span>
        </div>

        <section class="product-detail">
            <div class="detail-image">
                <img src="<%= product.image.replace('w=700', 'w=1000') %>" alt="<%= product.alt %>">
            </div>

            <div class="detail-content">
                <p class="eyebrow">Nike Running</p>
                <h1><%= product.name %></h1>
                <p class="detail-price">$<%= product.price %></p>

                <label class="quantity-label" for="quantity">Quantity</label>
                <select id="quantity" name="quantity">
                    <option value="1">1</option>
                    <option value="2">2</option>
                    <option value="3">3</option>
                </select>
                <button class="button button-dark button-large add-to-cart" type="button"
                    data-product-id="<%= product.id %>" data-product-name="<%= product.name %>">
                    Add to Cart
                </button>
                <p class="delivery-note">Free delivery and returns on all orders.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="detail-description">
                <h2>Description</h2>
                <p>The <%= product.name %> delivers comfort and a bold look for everyday movement. Its cushioned design and durable sole help you stay ready for whatever the day brings.</p>
                <p>The stitched details and carefully selected materials stay true to Nike's performance heritage, while updated construction delivers comfort all day long.</p>
                <p>Lightweight cushioning provides support and a bold look that works across generations of sneaker and sportswear culture.</p>
                <p>Whether you are heading out for a workout, running errands, or meeting friends, this piece moves with you and works with a variety of outfits.</p>
                <p>Pair it with joggers, jeans, or shorts for an easy everyday look. Its timeless silhouette makes it a staple in any collection.</p>
                <p>Free delivery and returns are available on all orders. Try it at home and send it back if the fit is not right.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>
    <script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
